  "changes_data": [
    {
      "diff": "@@ -1231,7 +1231,10 @@ https://1.na.dl.wireshark.org/download/src/wireshark-{wireshark-version}.tar.xz\n ===== Staying Current\n \n Wireshark releases are announced on the link:{wireshark-mailing-lists-url}[wireshark-announce] mailing list.\n-A https://appvisor.com/pad/[PAD] file is also published at https://www.wireshark.org/wireshark-pad.xml which contains the current stable version and release date.\n+\n+If you want to automatically check for the latest version, you can use one of the {wireshark-code-file-url}/ui/software_update.h[automatic update URLs] for our Windows or macOS packages, such as\n+\n+https://www.wireshark.org/update/0/Wireshark/0.0.0/Windows/x86-64/en-US/stable.xml\n \n [discrete]\n ===== Artwork\n",
      "collapsed": false,
